{"seq":3,"slug":"color-science","title":"色彩科学","stage":"DONE","category":"photography-video","categoryLabel":"摄影与视频","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/photography-video/color-science","rating":{"composite":3.56,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":2.5},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.2,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"introMarkdown":"# 色彩科学 简介\n\n色彩科学（Color Science）是摄影与视频制作的基石之一——它从物理学、生理学和心理学三个维度解释\"我们如何看见颜色\"以及\"如何在技术系统中精确再现颜色\"。从 RGB 加色模型到 CIE 色度图，从 ICC 色彩管理到创意白平衡，色彩科学为摄影师提供了超越\"好看\"直觉的系统性理解。\n\n本 Hub 分四章覆盖色彩科学的核心领域：色彩理论模型、色彩管理系统、白平衡控制、以及调色的理论基础。每一章都从物理/数学原理出发，落脚于摄影实践中的具体应用。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"color-theory","title":"色彩理论","docCount":3,"url":"/h/photography-video/color-science/color-theory","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"color-models","title":"色彩模型：RGB、HSL 与 Lab","url":"/h/photography-video/color-science/color-theory/color-models","wordCount":1457,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"color-wheel-harmony","title":"色轮与色彩和谐","url":"/h/photography-video/color-science/color-theory/color-wheel-harmony","wordCount":1579,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"digital-color-pipeline","title":"数字成像色彩流水线","url":"/h/photography-video/color-science/color-theory/digital-color-pipeline","wordCount":1499,"readingTime":6}],"introMarkdown":"# 色彩理论 简介\n\n色彩理论（Color Theory）研究颜色的分类、组合和感知规律。本章从 RGB、HSL、CIELAB 三大色彩模型入手，解析色轮关系、色彩和谐原则，以及数字成像中色彩从物理光谱到像素数值的转换路径。理解色彩模型是后续色彩管理和调色工作的数学基础。\n"},{"seq":2,"slug":"color-management","title":"色彩管理","docCount":3,"url":"/h/photography-video/color-science/color-management","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"color-spaces-gamut","title":"色彩空间与色域","url":"/h/photography-video/color-science/color-management/color-spaces-gamut","wordCount":1317,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"icc-profiles","title":"ICC 配置文件与色彩管理系统","url":"/h/photography-video/color-science/color-management/icc-profiles","wordCount":1430,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"monitor-calibration","title":"显示器校色实践","url":"/h/photography-video/color-science/color-management/monitor-calibration","wordCount":1699,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"# 色彩管理 简介\n\n色彩管理（Color Management）确保颜色从拍摄到显示到输出的一致性。本章覆盖色彩空间（sRGB、Adobe RGB、DCI-P3、Rec.2020）的特性与选择、ICC 配置文件的工作原理、以及显示器校色的实践流程。色彩管理是专业摄影工作流中不可跳过的环节。\n"},{"seq":3,"slug":"white-balance","title":"白平衡","docCount":3,"url":"/h/photography-video/color-science/white-balance","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"color-temperature","title":"色温与光源特性","url":"/h/photography-video/color-science/white-balance/color-temperature","wordCount":1364,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"mixed-lighting","title":"混合光源与白平衡挑战","url":"/h/photography-video/color-science/white-balance/mixed-lighting","wordCount":1620,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"creative-white-balance","title":"创意白平衡与色调设计","url":"/h/photography-video/color-science/white-balance/creative-white-balance","wordCount":1443,"readingTime":6}],"introMarkdown":"# 白平衡 简介\n\n白平衡（White Balance）是将场景中性灰还原为中性灰的过程——它决定了画面的整体色调倾向。本章解析色温的物理定义、混合光源场景的处理策略、以及超越\"正确\"追求创意表达的白平衡运用。从 AWB 算法到手动 K 值设定，白平衡是每一次拍摄都必须面对的第一个色彩决策。\n"},{"seq":4,"slug":"color-grading-theory","title":"调色理论","docCount":3,"url":"/h/photography-video/color-science/color-grading-theory","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"color-psychology","title":"色彩心理学与情感表达","url":"/h/photography-video/color-science/color-grading-theory/color-psychology","wordCount":1542,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"grading-direction","title":"调色方向与风格定义","url":"/h/photography-video/color-science/color-grading-theory/grading-direction","wordCount":1555,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"stylization-consistency","title":"风格化处理与视觉一致性","url":"/h/photography-video/color-science/color-grading-theory/stylization-consistency","wordCount":1632,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"# 调色理论 简介\n\n调色理论（Color Grading Theory）是色彩科学在创意表达中的应用层——它研究色彩如何影响情绪、如何建立视觉风格、以及如何通过系统性的色彩操作实现特定的审美目标。本章从色彩心理学出发，探讨调色的方向性选择、风格化处理的理论框架，为后续\"调色工艺\"Hub 中的实操技法提供认知基础。\n"}]}